  "goodToKnow": "Alarmieren means to alert or call out emergency services (die Polizei, den Notarzt, die Feuerwehr alarmieren) and to alarm: alarmiert sein (to be alarmed). Alarmierend means alarming: alarmierende Zahlen. In Germany, dial 112 for fire and ambulance and 110 for the police. Many volunteer firefighters are alarmiert by pager. Perfect without ge-: hat alarmiert."
